msgid "Otto"
msgstr ""

#: data/org.x.Otto.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Otto is a small screenshot utility for the Cinnamon desktop. It can capture "
"the entire screen, the active window, or a region selected with the mouse, "
"and offers a quick post-capture editor for cropping, rotating, and flipping "
"the result before saving or copying to the clipboard."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.x.Otto.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"Otto is a drop-in replacement for gnome-screenshot on Linux Mint and aims to "
"keep its command-line interface compatible."
msgstr ""
